<s-1 id="RM000000IZL00OX_01_0001" proc-id="RM0550J___000026X00000">
<ptxt>Inspect Windshield Deicer Operation</ptxt>
<content1 releasenbr="1">
<s2>
<ptxt>Turn IG ON.</ptxt>
</s2>
<s2>
<ptxt>Check that the indicator comes on and the windshield deicer warms up when the windshield deicer switch is pressed.</ptxt>
</s2>
<s2>
<ptxt>Check that the indicator goes off and deicer operation stops after approximately 15 minutes.</ptxt>
</s2>
</content1>
